{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[估计对象三分|目标、规则、数值]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Estimand, estimator, estimate*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "po",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[潜在结果反事实|潜在结果]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Potential outcomes*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "ate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": -160,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[平均处理效应|平均处理效应 ATE]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Average treatment effect*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "att",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[已处理者平均处理效应|处理组平均效应 ATET]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Effect among treated units*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "diff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 160,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## [[均值差的因果分解|观测均值差 = ATET + SB]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Observed contrast = ATET + selection bias*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "sb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## [[选择偏差|未处理基线差]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Selection bias in the mean contrast*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "rct",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## [[随机分配识别|随机分配识别]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Identification by random assignment*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "sample",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[二元回归的样本均值差|二元 OLS 的样本均值差]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*OLS as a sample mean difference*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "sampling",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[抽样分布|抽样分布]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Sampling distribution*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "conf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[混淆因子|处理与结果的共同原因]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*A common cause of treatment and outcome*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "did",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[双重差分法|其他反事实比较：DID]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Another counterfactual comparison: DID*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "match",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3000,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[协变量匹配|协变量匹配]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*Covariate matching*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    },
    {
      "id": "rd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3600,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## [[断点回归设计|阈值附近的局部比较]]\n\n<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n*A local comparison near a cutoff*\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->"
    }
  ],
